Modifications
-------------
Last modified: 2026-11-22

- Rebranded the application as WMC NEXUS, including the web UI, documentation
  and build metadata.
- Added English/Turkish localization infrastructure and translated the web UI.
- Added a first-party skill catalog and a skill authoring standard.
- Added Windows local setup documentation and helper scripts, including a
  Docker-free build path and a portable PostgreSQL launcher.
- Reworked skill documentation for the WMC NEXUS catalog.
- Removed the upstream issue-triage bot workflow from this repository.

This list is a summary, not an exhaustive diff. The complete source history is
available in this repository.

Source availability
-------------------
Because WMC NEXUS is licensed under AGPL-3.0, anyone who interacts with a
networked deployment must be able to obtain the corresponding source. Keep the
repository public, or provide a written offer and a source archive with any
binary distribution.
